# Accepted findings. Each one is a decision, not an oversight.

# EKS public API endpoint. It's restricted to var.cluster_admin_cidrs
# (validated to never be 0.0.0.0/0), so AWS-0041 passes. A private-only
# endpoint needs a VPN or bastion, which is out of scope for staging.
AVD-AWS-0040

# Node egress to 0.0.0.0/0 (from the EKS module). Nodes pull images and call
# AWS APIs through the NAT gateway. Locking egress down needs VPC endpoints for
# ECR, S3, STS, SQS and SNS plus a proxy for everything else; that's the
# production hardening step.
AVD-AWS-0104
